From: =?UTF-8?q?Witold=20Gre=C5=84?= <witold.gren@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:25:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] ws: cached-only snapshots, passive refresh while
 connected, snapshot_dir

?cached=true serves the cached JPEG (404 if none) and never wakes the
camera. While the camera is connected anyway, the snapshot is refreshed
passively when older than snapshot_refresh (s, default 60), and saved to
snapshot_dir so it survives restarts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
